return ['domain'=>'zinn-order-updates','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-order-updates','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-11T11:19:43+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-11T11:19:43+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Order Updates'=>'Zinn® Order Updates','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates','SMS and WhatsApp order updates for your store, sent through Zinn® Campaigns under your store\'s own name. Connect in one click; no keys to paste.'=>'Taarifa za oda kupitia SMS na WhatsApp kwa duka lako, zilizotumwa kupitia Zinn® Campaigns chini ya jina la duka lako lenyewe. Unganisha kwa mbofyo mmoja; hakuna funguo za kubandika.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Read and send SMS and WhatsApp order updates for this store.'=>'Soma na utume sasisho za maagizo kupitia SMS na WhatsApp kwa duka hili.','The WooCommerce order ID.'=>'Kitambulisho cha agizo la WooCommerce.','Get order messages'=>'Pata ujumbe wa agizo','Lists every SMS or WhatsApp update for one order, newest first, with its outcome. The phone number is masked.'=>'Inaorodhesha kila sasisho la SMS au WhatsApp kwa agizo moja, jipya zaidi kwanza, likiwa na matokeo yake. Nambari ya simu imefichwa.','Send an order update'=>'Tuma sasisho la agizo','Sends one approved order update (never free text) to the shopper of the order, only if they agreed to receive it. Reusing a request_id never sends twice.'=>'Hutuma sasisho moja la agizo lililoidhinishwa (kamwe si maandishi ya bure) kwa mnunuzi wa agizo, ikiwa tu alikubali kulipokea. Kutumia tena request_id hakutumi mara mbili kamwe.','Which approved update to send.'=>'Ni sasisho gani lililoidhinishwa la kutuma.','A unique ID for this send (8 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes or underscores). Send the same ID again to retry safely.'=>'Kitambulisho cha kipekee cha utumaji huu (herufi, nambari, vitone, vistari au vistari vya chini 8 hadi 64). Tuma kitambulisho kilekile tena ili ujaribu tena kwa usalama.','Optional https tracking link for a shipped update.'=>'Kiungo cha hiari cha ufuatiliaji cha https kwa sasisho lililosafirishwa.','Get connection health'=>'Pata hali ya muunganisho','Shows whether this store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns and what Zinn® Campaigns sees for it.'=>'Inaonyesha ikiwa duka hili limeunganishwa kwenye Zinn® Campaigns na kile ambacho Zinn® Campaigns inaona kwa ajili yake.','Choose one of the approved order updates.'=>'Chagua mojawapo ya masasisho ya agizo yaliyoidhinishwa.','The request ID must be 8 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes or underscores.'=>'Kitambulisho cha ombi lazima kiwe na herufi, tarakimu, nukta, dashi au mistari ya chini 8 hadi 64.','Connect this store to Zinn® Campaigns first.'=>'Unganisha duka hili kwenye Zinn® Campaigns kwanza.','There is no order with that ID on this store.'=>'Hakuna agizo lenye kitambulisho hicho kwenye duka hili.','Zinn® Campaigns could not be reached. Try again in a minute.'=>'Haikuweza kuunganishwa na Zinn® Campaigns. Jaribu tena baada ya dakika moja.','Zinn® Campaigns refused the request.'=>'Zinn® Campaigns imekataa ombi.','Order Updates'=>'Taarifa za Agizo','Your store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Duka lako limeunganishwa kwenye Zinn® Campaigns.','Your store is disconnected. No messages will be sent.'=>'Duka lako limetenganishwa. Hakuna ujumbe utakaotumwa.','That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again.'=>'Muunganisho huo ulichukua muda mrefu sana au ulianzishwa katika kivinjari kingine. Bonyeza Unganisha tena.','Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support.'=>'Zinn® haikukubali muunganisho. Bonyeza "Unganisha" tena; ikiwa itaendelea kushindwa, wasiliana na usaidizi wa Zinn®.','Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again.'=>'Tovuti yako haikuweza kufikia Zinn®. Hakikisha kwamba mpangishaji wako anaruhusu miunganisho inayotoka nje, kisha ubonyeze «Unganisha tena».','Help'=>'Usaidizi','Send your customers SMS and WhatsApp updates about their orders, under your store\'s own name, paid from your Zinn® credit.'=>'Watumie wateja wako taarifa za maagizo yao kupitia SMS na WhatsApp, chini ya jina la duka lako mwenyewe, zikilipwa kutoka kwa salio lako la Zinn®.','Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this store, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key.'=>'Unganisha inafungua Zinn® katika dirisha hili. Ingia au ufungue akaunti, idhinisha duka hili, nawe utarudi moja kwa moja hapa. Hutawahi kubandika ufunguo.','Connect to Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Unganisha kwenye Zinn® Campaigns','Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly.'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini Zinn® haikuweza kufikiwa sasa hivi. Tutajaribu tena hivi karibuni.','Store'=>'Duka','Connected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns','Open for your account'=>'Wazi kwa akaunti yako','Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is.'=>'Bado haijafunguliwa kwa ajili ya akaunti yako. Zinn® itakutumia barua pepe itakapokuwa tayari.','Disconnect'=>'Tenganisha','You are not allowed to connect this store.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuunganisha duka hili.','You are not allowed to disconnect this store.'=>'Huruhusiwi kukata muunganisho wa duka hili.','Send me order updates by SMS to my phone number. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to stop.'=>'Nitumie masasisho ya agizo kwa SMS kwenye nambari yangu ya simu. Huenda viwango vya kawaida vya ujumbe na data vikatozwa. Jibu STOP ili kusitisha.','Connection'=>'Muunganisho','You are not allowed to do that.'=>'Huruhusiwi kufanya hivyo.','Thank you. You can now ask for help and send reports to Zinn® support.'=>'Asante. Sasa unaweza kuomba usaidizi na kutuma ripoti kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®.','Consent withdrawn. Nothing is sent to Zinn® support until you agree again.'=>'Idhini imeondolewa. Hakuna kitakachotumwa kwa usaidizi wa Zinn® hadi utakapokubali tena.','The Zinn® AI could not answer just now. Send your question to the team below; a person will reply.'=>'AI ya Zinn® haikuweza kujibu sasa hivi. Tuma swali lako kwa timu iliyo hapa chini; mtu atajibu.','Glad that solved it.'=>'Imefurahisha kwamba hilo limetatua tatizo.','Sent. Your ticket is %s; the team replies here and by e-mail.'=>'Imetumwa. Tiketi yako ni %s; timu itajibu hapa na kupitia barua pepe.','Fill in the subject, the message and, while your store is not connected, your e-mail address.'=>'Jaza mada, ujumbe na, wakati duka lako halijaunganishwa, anwani yako ya barua pepe.','Zinn® did not accept the ticket. Check the fields and try again; if it keeps failing, e-mail support@zinndigital.com.'=>'Zinn® haikukubali tiketi. Kagua sehemu husika na ujaribu tena; ikiendelea kushindikana, tuma barua pepe kwa support@zinndigital.com.','Too many requests in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Maombi mengi mno kwa muda mfupi. Subiri dakika chache kisha ujaribu tena.','Reply sent.'=>'Jibu limetumwa.','That ticket is closed. Send a new ticket instead.'=>'Tiketi hiyo imefungwa. Tuma tiketi mpya badala yake.','Your reply could not be sent. Try again in a moment.'=>'Jibu lako halikuweza kutumwa. Jaribu tena baada ya muda mfupi.','Waiting on Zinn® support'=>'Inasubiri usaidizi wa Zinn®','Waiting on you'=>'Inakusubiri wewe','Answered'=>'Imejibiwa','Closed'=>'Imefungwa','Report a bug'=>'Ripoti hitilafu','Send feedback'=>'Tuma maoni','Request a feature'=>'Omba kipengele','Ask for help'=>'Omba usaidizi','Versions: WordPress, PHP, this plugin, WooCommerce (and whether it uses HPOS) and the supported plugins we detected'=>'Toleo: WordPress, PHP, programu-jalizi hii, WooCommerce (na kama inatumia HPOS) na programu-jalizi zinazotumika tulizozigundua','Your active theme and its version'=>'Mandhari yako amilifu na toleo lake','The list of installed plugins, their versions and whether each is active'=>'Orodha ya programu-jalizi zilizosakinishwa, matoleo yake na ikiwa kila moja inatumika','Connection: your store address, whether it is connected, this install\'s id and whether Zinn® answered its last check (never the store\'s token)'=>'Muunganisho: anwani ya duka lako, ikiwa limeunganishwa, kitambulisho cha usakinishaji huu na ikiwa Zinn® ilijibu ukaguzi wake wa mwisho (kamwe si tokeni ya duka)','Zinn® Order Updates: Help'=>'Masasisho ya Maagizo ya Zinn®: Usaidizi','Withdraw my consent to send help requests'=>'Ondoa idhini yangu ya kutuma maombi ya usaidizi','Help here is answered by Zinn Digital® Ltd. Before anything leaves your site, this is exactly what is sent, and where:'=>'Msaada hapa unajibiwa na Zinn Digital® Ltd. Kabla ya chochote kuondoka kwenye tovuti yako, hiki ndicho hasa kinachotumwa, na wapi:','A question you type: sent to the Zinn® AI at api.zinndigital.com, which answers from the Zinn® help articles.'=>'Swali unaloandika: hutumwa kwa Zinn® AI kwenye api.zinndigital.com, ambayo hujibu kutoka kwa makala za usaidizi za Zinn®.','A ticket you send: its subject, your message, your admin language and a reply e-mail address, sent to Zinn® support.'=>'Tiketi unayotuma: somo lake, ujumbe wako, lugha yako ya msimamizi na anwani ya barua pepe ya kujibu, iliyotumwa kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®.','Diagnostics: only the blocks you tick, each shown in full before you send. Never the store\'s token, passwords or your customers\' details.'=>'Uchunguzi: vizuizi unavyoweka tiki pekee, kila kimoja kikionyeshwa kikamilifu kabla ya kutuma. Kamwe si tokeni ya duka, manenosiri au maelezo ya wateja wako.','Your tickets: while your store is connected, this screen reads your tickets and the team\'s replies from Zinn®.'=>'Tiketi zako: duka lako likiwa limeunganishwa, skrini hii husoma tiketi zako na majibu ya timu kutoka Zinn®.','We record who agreed and when. You can withdraw at any time on this screen.'=>'Tunarekodi ni nani aliyekubali na lini. Unaweza kuondoa idhini wakati wowote kwenye skrini hii.','Agree and continue'=>'Kubali na uendelee','Ask the Zinn® AI'=>'Uliza Zinn® AI','What do you need help with?'=>'Unahitaji msaada gani?','Ask'=>'Uliza','Help articles'=>'Makala ya usaidizi','That solved it'=>'Hii imetatua tatizo','Still need help? Send it to the team below.'=>'Bado unahitaji usaidizi? Itume kwa timu iliyo hapa chini.','Send it to the Zinn® team'=>'Itume kwa timu ya Zinn®','What is it?'=>'Ni nini?','Subject'=>'Mada','What happened? For a bug, the steps that show it.'=>'Nini kilitokea? Kwa hitilafu, hatua zinazoionyesha.','Reply e-mail'=>'Barua pepe ya kujibu','Leave empty to use the e-mail of the Zinn® member who connected this store.'=>'Acha wazi ili utumie barua pepe ya mwanachama wa Zinn® aliyeunganisha duka hili.','Your store is not connected, so the team replies by e-mail.'=>'Duka lako halijaunganishwa, kwa hivyo timu hujibu kupitia barua pepe.','Diagnostics (optional). Tick a block to attach it; this is exactly what is sent.'=>'Uchunguzi (si lazima). Weka alama kwenye kisanduku ili kukiambatanisha; hiki ndicho hasa kinachotumwa.','Send to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','My tickets'=>'Tiketi zangu','Connect your store to follow your tickets here. Until then the team replies by e-mail.'=>'Unganisha duka lako ili kufuatilia tiketi zako hapa. Hadi wakati huo, timu hujibu kwa barua pepe.','Your tickets could not be loaded just now. Try again in a moment.'=>'Tiketi zako hazikuweza kupakiwa sasa hivi. Jaribu tena baada ya muda mfupi.','No tickets yet.'=>'Bado hakuna tiketi.','Zinn® support replied on %s:'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn® ulijibu mnamo %s:','Your reply'=>'Jibu lako','Send reply'=>'Tuma jibu','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn® SMS and WhatsApp sign-up'=>'Kujisajili kwa SMS na WhatsApp kwa Zinn®','Lets visitors sign up for offers and news by SMS or WhatsApp. Unticked by default; marketing only.'=>'Huruhusu wageni kujiandikisha kupokea ofa na habari kupitia SMS au WhatsApp. Haijachaguliwa kwa chaguomsingi; kwa ajili ya uuzaji pekee.','Sign-up settings'=>'Mipangilio ya kujisajili','Channel'=>'Kituo','SMS'=>'SMS','WhatsApp'=>'WhatsApp','Visitor chooses SMS or WhatsApp'=>'Mgeni anachagua SMS au WhatsApp','Zinn® SMS offers consent'=>'Idhini ya matoleo ya SMS ya Zinn®','Zinn® WhatsApp offers consent'=>'Idhini ya ofa za Zinn® kupitia WhatsApp','Records a marketing opt-in in Zinn® Campaigns for the phone number in this form.'=>'Hurekodi idhini ya uuzaji katika Zinn® Campaigns kwa nambari ya simu iliyo kwenye fomu hii.','Send me offers and news on WhatsApp to this number. Optional; unsubscribe any time.'=>'Nitumie ofa na habari kupitia WhatsApp kwa nambari hii. Si lazima; jiondoe wakati wowote.','Send me offers and news by SMS to this number. Optional; unsubscribe any time by replying STOP. Message and data rates may apply.'=>'Nitumie ofa na habari kwa SMS kwa nambari hii. Si lazima; jiondoe wakati wowote kwa kujibu STOP. Gharama za ujumbe na data zinaweza kutozwa.','Connect this store to Zinn® Campaigns to show this sign-up form.'=>'Unganisha duka hili na Zinn® Campaigns ili kuonyesha fomu hii ya kujisajili.','Mobile number'=>'Nambari ya simu ya mkononi','How should we send them?'=>'Tuzitume vipi?','Send me offers and news by the channel I chose above. Optional; unsubscribe any time.'=>'Nitumie ofa na habari kupitia njia niliyochagua hapo juu. Si lazima; unaweza kujiondoa wakati wowote.','Leave this empty'=>'Acha hili wazi','Sign up'=>'Jisajili','Thank you, you are signed up. You can unsubscribe any time.'=>'Asante, umejiandikisha. Unaweza kujiondoa wakati wowote.','Please enter your mobile number with its country code, for example +44 7700 900123.'=>'Tafadhali weka nambari yako ya simu ya mkononi ikiwa na msimbo wa nchi, kwa mfano +44 7700 900123.','Please tick the box to agree.'=>'Tafadhali weka alama kwenye kisanduku ili ukubali.','This form was open for a long time. Please reload the page and send it again.'=>'Fomu hii imekuwa wazi kwa muda mrefu. Tafadhali pakia upya ukurasa na uitume tena.','Too many sign-ups from here. Please wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Usajili mwingi mno kutoka hapa. Tafadhali subiri dakika chache kisha ujaribu tena.','We could not save your sign-up. Please check your number and try again.'=>'Hatuwezi kuhifadhi usajili wako. Tafadhali angalia nambari yako kisha ujaribu tena.','my account endpoint slugmessages'=>'Ujumbe','Messages'=>'Ujumbe','Text me updates about my orders'=>'Nitumie masasisho kuhusu maagizo yangu kwa njia ya ujumbe','Text me offers and news from this store'=>'Nitumie ofa na habari kutoka kwa duka hili kwa njia ya ujumbe mfupi','Send me offers and news from this store on WhatsApp'=>'Nitumie ofa na habari kutoka duka hili kwenye WhatsApp','Order received'=>'Agizo limepokelewa','Payment received'=>'Malipo yamepokelewa','Order on hold'=>'Agizo limesitishwa','Order shipped'=>'Agizo limesafirishwa','Order completed'=>'Agizo limekamilika','Ready for pickup'=>'Tayari kuchukuliwa','Payment failed'=>'Malipo yameshindikana','Order cancelled'=>'Agizo limeghairiwa','Order refunded'=>'Agizo limerejeshwa fedha','Order update'=>'Sasisho la agizo','Your message settings cover the mobile number on your orders with this store. Use the number from one of your orders.'=>'Mipangilio ya ujumbe wako inahusu nambari ya simu ya mkononi kwenye maagizo yako katika duka hili. Tumia nambari kutoka kwa mojawapo ya maagizo yako.','Your message settings are saved.'=>'Mipangilio yako ya ujumbe imehifadhiwa.','Done. This store will not send you any more messages.'=>'Imekamilika. Duka hili halitakutumia ujumbe wowote zaidi.','Please enter a mobile number with its country code, for example +44 7700 900123.'=>'Tafadhali weka nambari ya simu ya mkononi ikiwa na msimbo wa nchi, kwa mfano +44 7700 900123.','We could not save your settings just now. Please try again in a minute.'=>'Hatuwezi kuhifadhi mipangilio yako sasa hivi. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika moja.','Your message settings cannot be shown just now. Please try again in a minute.'=>'Mipangilio ya ujumbe wako haiwezi kuonyeshwa sasa hivi. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika moja.','Messages from this store'=>'Ujumbe kutoka duka hili','Save'=>'Hifadhi','Stop all messages'=>'Simamisha jumbe zote','Recent messages'=>'Ujumbe wa hivi karibuni','This store has not sent you any messages yet.'=>'Duka hili bado halijakutumia ujumbe wowote.','%1$s, order %2$s, %3$s'=>'%1$s, agizo %2$s, %3$s','Sign in to manage the messages this store sends you.'=>'Ingia ili udhibiti ujumbe ambao duka hili linakutumia.','Zinn® message settings'=>'Mipangilio ya ujumbe wa Zinn®','Lets a signed-in shopper change the text messages your store sends them, stop them all, and see the last 20.'=>'Humruhusu mnunuzi aliyeingia kwenye akaunti kubadilisha ujumbe wa maandishi unaotumwa na duka lako, kusitisha yote, na kuona 20 za mwisho.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya mtumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® Pro Membership: every Pro plugin, one licence'=>'Uanachama wa Zinn® Pro: kila programu-jalizi ya Pro, leseni moja','The Pro versions of Page Builder Sandwich, Tranzly, Zinn® SEO, Zinn® Cache and Zinn® Backups, and every Pro plugin we release next, from %s a year. A second membership adds Zinn® Chat Pro.'=>'Toleo za Pro za Page Builder Sandwich, Tranzly, Zinn® SEO, Zinn® Cache na Zinn® Backups, na kila programu-jalizi ya Pro tutakayotoa baadaye, kuanzia %s kwa mwaka. Uanachama wa pili unaongeza Zinn® Chat Pro.','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Ukaribishaji wa Zinn® kwa WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamishaji wa bila malipo na paneli dhibiti iliyojengwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha tovuti zaidi ya moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti zilizodumu, vikoa na nafasi za viungo, huku pesa zikiwekwa salama hadi pande zote mbili ziridhike.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — waajiri watu wanaofanya kazi hii kama taaluma yao','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari huduma zaidi ya 10,000 zilizo tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, wasanidi programu na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwape nafasi ya kutuma maombi.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama maelezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Huduma ya usasishaji ya Zinn® haikutoa kiungo cha kupakua kwa sasisho hili. Angalia kuwa tovuti hii inaweza kufikia jukwaa la Zinn®, kisha ujaribu tena.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Sasisho halikuweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwa huduma ya sasisho ya Zinn® (%s). Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa limeshindwa ukaguzi wa uadilifu na halijasakinishwa.','Order updates'=>'Taarifa za agizo','Opted in (yes or no)'=>'Imechaguliwa (ndiyo au hapana)','Channel (SMS or WhatsApp)'=>'Kituo (SMS au WhatsApp)','WhatsApp link'=>'Kiungo cha WhatsApp','Message us on WhatsApp'=>'Tutumie ujumbe kwenye WhatsApp','Zinn® WhatsApp button'=>'Kitufe cha WhatsApp cha Zinn®','A button that opens a WhatsApp chat with your store. It shows only once your WhatsApp number is connected in Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Kitufe kinachofungua gumzo la WhatsApp na duka lako. Inaonekana tu pindi nambari yako ya WhatsApp inapounganishwa katika Zinn® Campaigns.','Button settings'=>'Mipangilio ya kitufe','Button text'=>'Maandishi ya kitufe','Show to'=>'Onyesha kwa','Everyone'=>'Kila mtu','Shoppers not yet getting order updates'=>'Wanunuzi bado hawajapata masasisho ya agizo','Connect your WhatsApp number in Zinn® Campaigns to show this button. Until then it shows nothing on your site.'=>'Unganisha nambari yako ya WhatsApp katika Zinn® Campaigns ili kuonyesha kitufe hiki. Hadi wakati huo hakitaonyesha chochote kwenye tovuti yako.']];